00:09:24.363 --> 00:09:26.933
I'm never going to stop fighting for you.

00:09:26.933 --> 00:09:28.935
We use every tool at our disposal

00:09:28.935 --> 00:09:29.969
to get you the student debt

00:09:29.969 --> 00:09:32.071
relief you need and reach your dreams.

00:09:32.672 --> 00:09:34.240
It's good for the economy.

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:35.841
It's good for the country.

00:09:35.841 --> 00:09:37.443
It's going to be good for you.

00:09:37.443 --> 00:09:39.745
Thank you very, very much for listening.

00:09:40.179 --> 00:09:41.247
We're going to get this done.

00:09:41.247 --> 00:09:41.881
God willing.

00:09:41.881 --> 00:09:43.215
Thank you, Mr. President.

00:09:43.215 --> 00:09:45.117
Why did you give millions of borrowers

00:09:45.117 --> 00:09:45.785
false hope?

00:09:45.785 --> 00:09:46.452
You've dated,

00:09:46.452 --> 00:09:47.887
doubted your own authority

00:09:47.887 --> 00:09:48.721
here in the past?

00:09:48.721 --> 00:09:51.190
I didn't give any false hope.

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:53.426
The question was whether or not

00:09:53.426 --> 00:09:55.928
I would do even more than was requested.

00:09:55.928 --> 00:09:56.596
What I did,

00:09:56.596 --> 00:09:58.064
I felt, was appropriate

00:09:58.064 --> 00:09:59.198
and was able to be done

00:09:59.198 --> 00:10:00.499
and would get done.

00:10:00.499 --> 00:10:02.168
I didn't give borrowers false hope,

00:10:02.168 --> 00:10:04.303
but the Republicans snatched away

00:10:04.637 --> 00:10:06.305
the hope that they were given.

00:10:06.305 --> 00:10:08.140
And it's real, real hope.

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:09.075
Thank you, Mr. President.

00:10:09.075 --> 00:10:11.510
But you can say that you already did.

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:13.145
You overstepped the authority.

00:10:13.145 --> 00:10:14.880
I think the court misinterpret

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:16.549
the Constitution.

00:10:16.549 --> 00:10:17.883
Mr. President, what do you mean?

00:10:17.883 --> 00:10:19.452
The failure in Afghanistan?

00:10:21.053 --> 00:10:21.587
Mistakes.

00:10:21.587 --> 00:10:22.054
There was

00:10:22.054 --> 00:10:22.421
there was

00:10:22.421 --> 00:10:24.357
a report on Afghanistan in withdrawal

00:10:24.357 --> 00:10:26.325
saying there was failure or mistakes.

00:10:26.325 --> 00:10:27.660
Do you admit

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:30.296
there was mistakes during the withdrawal

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:32.098
and before

00:10:32.098 --> 00:10:33.432
all the evidence is coming back here?

00:10:33.432 --> 00:10:35.701
Remember what I said about Afghanistan?

00:10:35.701 --> 00:10:38.371
I said Al Qaida would not be there.

00:10:38.371 --> 00:10:39.271
We said it wouldn't be.

00:10:39.271 --> 00:10:41.307
I said we get help from the Taliban.

00:10:41.307 --> 00:10:42.942
What's happening now?

00:10:42.942 --> 00:10:44.310
What's going on?

00:10:44.477 --> 00:10:46.145
Read your press.

00:10:46.479 --> 00:10:47.613
I was right

00:10:49.248 --> 00:10:50.016
Thanks.

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:51.183
So far.

00:10:51.183 --> 00:10:52.785
So the report is from the State

00:10:52.785 --> 00:10:53.386
Department, actually,

00:10:53.386 --> 00:10:54.186
about the withdrawal.

